# Packaging rules

- Packaging is Windows-first.
- Bundle portable adb with the app.
- Keep payload layout predictable and relative-path based.
- Inno Setup should support optional post-install launch using [Run] with postinstall behavior.
- Do not hardcode machine-specific paths.
- Build scripts should be PowerShell and idempotent where practical.
- GitHub README must keep serving `SingularityApkInstaller-win-x64-setup.exe` from `/releases/latest/download/`.